rvices, Raffles Residences &amp; Penthouses offers the pinnacle of resort-style living in one of Dubai’s most prestigious locations.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_7efaa05578.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_7efaa05578","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_31acab83de.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_31acab83de","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_8a7f910e0d.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_8a7f910e0d","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_ea8d7d9c75.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_ea8d7d9c75","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_4dc4108f6e.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_4dc4108f6e","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_54673debb5.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_54673debb5","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_3f73213c9c.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_3f73213c9c","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentest