<li>Private &amp; Secure Living – Includes private elevators to penthouses, personal security services, and 24-hour concierge for an elite lifestyle.</li><li>Gourmet Dining &amp; Entertainment – Offers a Japanese fine-dining restaurant, a jazz bar, a beach club, and a private cinema for an extraordinary social experience.</li><li>Resort-Style Amenities – Includes a mini golf course, beach volleyball, Raffles Kids Club, valet parking, and full hotel services.</li><li>Signature Personalized Services – Residents enjoy Raffles Signature Butler &amp; Concierge, personal chefs, luxury limousine service, housekeeping, and beauty &amp; wellness services.</li><li>Investment &amp; Exclusivity – A limited-edition collection of designer-furnished residences, offering strong capital appreciation in Dubai’s most prestigious neighborhood.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1411,"cta":{"id":2188,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_ed5fff3e72.jpg","hash":"Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_ed5fff3e72","name":"Raffles Residences & Penthouses, The Palm Duba"},"style":null,"title":"A Prestigious Address on Palm Jumeirah, Where Luxury Meets Iconic Views.","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Nestled on the exclusive Crescent West of Palm Jumeirah, Raffles Residences &amp; Penthouses, The Palm Dubai offers an unrivaled waterfront lifestyle in one of the world's most prestigious destinations. Overlooking the Arabian Gulf, Dubai skyline, and pristine private beaches, this prime location provides seamless access to Dubai’s vibrant hotspots, including Downtown Dubai, Dubai Marina, and world-class dining, shopping, and entertainment venues. With its serene beachfront setting, breathtaking views, and proximity to the city's finest attractions, this iconic address redefines luxury living at its best.</p><ul><li>Atlantis The Palm – 5 minutes</li><li>The Pointe, Palm Jumeirah – 7 minutes</li><li>Nakheel Mall – 10 minutes</li><li>Dubai Marina – 15 minutes</li><li>Ain Dubai (Bluewaters Island) – 20 minutes</li><li>Mall of the Emirates – 20 minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":2803,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/06/22/X1g3diAHaPHQ2CWK2NVTFvsDjF9S0hWnm2OgIt4Q.pdf","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_5561400e6a.pdf","hash":"Brochure_5561400e6a","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":1029,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3370,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3371,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3372,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3373,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3374,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 bedroom Royal Residental Villas","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3375,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 Bedroom Triplex Penthouses","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"f